    {
      "heading": "What this course is",
      "points": [
        {
          "text": "Eight steps of attention practice.",
          "origin": "extract"
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "heading": "What the research shows — unrounded",
      "points": [
        {
          "text": "The largest review assembled for medical decision-making (Goyal et al., JAMA Internal Medicine, 2014; 47 clinical trials, 3,515 people) gives mindfulness programmes a small effect: anxiety d≈0.38, depression d≈0.30, pain d≈0.33 — against active controls.",
          "origin": "extract"
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "heading": "What the course does not do",
      "points": [],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "heading": "Risks named before the practice, not after",
      "points": [
        {
          "text": "The reason is simple: 84% of clinical trials never asked about adverse events at all (Wong et al., cited in Baer et al., 2019).",
          "origin": "extract"
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "heading": "Who may need company for this format",
      "points": [
        {
          "text": "Not a ban and not a filter — routing.",
          "origin": "extract"
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "heading": "Stop signals",
      "points": [
        {
          "text": "If the heaviness persists beyond the session, contact a living professional.",
          "origin": "extract"
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    }
  ],
